D, and includes strength equipment, cardio machines, a TRX room, and a basketball court.","source_url":"https://csumb.edu/athletics/otter-sports-center/","source_title":"Otter Sports Center","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Valid Otter ID required. The center closes on campus holidays and home basketball or volleyball game days; verify current hours.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"skylight-transmission-of-knowledge-windows-to-justice","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Skylight: Transmission of Knowledge/Windows to Justice","title":"Sunday Close: Read the CAHSS Mural","subtitle":"Finish at the main entrance of CAHSS Building 504","notes":"Walk the mural from end to end, then use the front-door signage to identify details such as the khipu cords, marigolds, lenses, and scales.","short_summary":"A final reflective stop connecting environmental, cultural, technological, and social-justice imagery.","evidence_claim":"CSUMB documents Johanna Poethig’s acrylic mural Skylight: Transmission of Knowledge/Windows to Justice at the main entrance of CAHSS Building 504 and notes interpretive signage at the front doors.","source_url":"https://csumb.edu/cahss/about/announcements-events/cahss-academic-iii-mural/","source_title":"CAHSS 504 (Academic III) Mural","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"View the exterior entrance artwork without blocking doors; interior building access may vary by day and academic schedule.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
